ing GPT‑2 to generate cells and text, showing a generative decoder architecture built on a pre‑trained large language model.",INCLUDE,,,,,,,"The abstract introduces Cell2Sentence, a new method that converts single‑cell transcriptomics into textual sentences and fine‑tunes GPT‑2, demonstrating generation of cells from text inputs and prediction of cell types from sentences; this constitutes a primary multimodal generative model linking natural language and biology. | The abstract reports fine‑tuning GPT‑2 (a decoder LLM) to generate cells and text, confirming a generative architecture; it also leverages a pre‑trained large language model, indicating foundation‑model properties.",thin_or_truncated_abstract;wrapper_boundary;text_component_boundary;generative_boundary;biological_token_only
