Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url"><span>OpenUrl</span></a><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=10.1038/s41587-021-01139-4&amp;link_type=DOI" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-doi cit-ref-sprinkles-crossref"><span>CrossRef</span></a><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=35027729&amp;link_type=MED&amp;atom=%2Fbiorxiv%2Fearly%2F2026%2F04%2F24%2F2026.04.21.717342.atom" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-medline"><span>PubMed</span></a></div></div></li><li><span class="ref-label">59.</span><a class="rev-xref-ref" href="#xref-ref-59-1" title="View reference 59. in text" id="ref-59">↵</a><div class="cit ref-cit ref-journal" id="cit-2026.04.21.717342v1.59" data-doi="10.1111/imr.12985"><div class="cit-metadata"><cite><span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Nitta</span>,  <span class="cit-name-given-names">T.</span></span>, <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Ota</span>,  <span class="cit-name-given-names">A.</span></span>, <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Iguchi</span>,  <span class="cit-name-given-names">T.</span></span>, <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Muro</span>,  <span class="cit-name-given-names">R.</span></span> &amp; <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Takayanagi</span>,  <span class="cit-name-given-names">H.</span></span> <span class="cit-article-title">The fibroblast: an emerging key player in thymic T cell selection</span>. <abbr class="cit-jnl-abbrev">Immunol. Rev</abbr>. <span class="cit-vol">302</span>, <span class="cit-fpage">68</span>–<span class="cit-lpage">85</span> (<span class="cit-pub-date">2021</span>).</cite></div><div class="cit-extra"><a href="{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DImmunol.%2BRev%26rft.volume%253D302%26rft.spage%253D68%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Adoi%252F10.1111%252Fimr.12985%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Apmid%252F34096078%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ctx_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url"><span>OpenUrl</span></a><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=10.1111/imr.12985&amp;link_type=DOI" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-doi cit-ref-sprinkles-crossref"><span>CrossRef</span></a><a href="/lookup/external-ref?access_num=34096078&amp;link_type=MED&amp;atom=%2Fbiorxiv%2Fearly%2F2026%2F04%2F24%2F2026.04.21.717342.atom" class="cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-medline"><span>PubMed</span></a></div></div></li><li><span class="ref-label">60.</span><a class="rev-xref-ref" href="#xref-ref-60-1" title="View reference 60. in text" id="ref-60">↵</a><div class="cit ref-cit ref-journal" id="cit-2026.04.21.717342v1.60" data-doi="10.1126/science.aba7721"><div class="cit-metadata"><cite><span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Cao</span>  <span class="cit-name-given-names">J</span></span>, <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">O’Day</span>  <span class="cit-name-given-names">DR</span></span>, <span class="cit-auth"><span class="cit-name-surname">Pliner</span>  <span class="cit-name-given-names">HA</span></span>, <span class="cit-etal">et al.</span> <span class="cit-article-title">A human cell atlas of fetal gene expression</span>. <abbr class="cit-jnl-abbrev">Science</abbr>. <span class="cit-pub-date">2020</span>;<span class="cit-vol">370</span>(<span class="cit-issue">6518</span>):<span class="cit-fpage">eaba7721</span>.</cite></div><div class="cit-extra"><a href="{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DScience%26rft.stitle%253DScience%26rft.aulast%253DCao%26rft.auinit1%253DJ.%26rft.volume%253D370%26rft.issue%253D6518%26rft.spage%253Deaba7721%26rft.epage%253Deaba7721%26rft.atitle%253DA%2Bhuman%2Bcell%2Batlas%2Bof%2Bfetal%2Bgene%2Bexpression%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Adoi%252F10.1126%252Fscience.aba7721%2