{"results":[{"record_id":"full_2026-07-06__rec_001358","paper_type":"application_wrapper","generative_model_present":"unclear","foundation_model_evidence":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"application_wrapper","uncertainty_reason":"generative_status_unclear","decision_rationale":"The record centers on parameter-efficient fine-tuning of an existing scGPT backbone, so it reads as an application/wrapper rather than a new primary model paper. It also describes broad pretraining and transfer across a large lung cancer atlas, but does not clearly state a generative mechanism in the provided sections.","evidence_snippet":"\"single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT\"; \"native scGPT backbone\"; \"strong biological prior captured during pretraining\"; \"generalizability\"; \"cell embeddings generated by native scGPT\"; \"large-scale disease contexts\""}]}
